select app.guide_release_section('va', 'shared-tools', 'chapter', 'car-maintenance', 'Every function has the calendar and Find a renter. Use them to answer questions fast.

## The calendar

1. Every car, its bookings, requests and blocks. The red line is now.
2. Use the arrows, Today and the range to move around, or search by plate, booking or name.
3. Fleet and customer service can remove a cleaning block from its side panel (**Remove the block**) when a car is ready sooner.

![](/guides/img/va-cs-09-calendar-desktop-541a6da5.jpg "desktop; size: 1230 800; address: carmacars.ca/va/calendar; pins: 1 60.2 33.8, 2 28.5 17.5")

## Find a car

**Bookings** > **Find a car** (Finance and Fleet: **Rentals** > **Find a car**). A renter quotes the car code on the car''s page (like CC-7F3A).

1. Type the car code, a plate, a VIN or the name. Each car shows its code, plate, status and its page on the site.
2. In Add a rental, type the car code or plate in the box above Car to choose it.

## Find a renter

1. Search by name, email, phone or booking number.
2. Opening a renter''s private details asks for a reason (**Open with a reason**). It is kept in the access log.

![](/guides/img/va-cs-07-renters-desktop-99cfd0ef.jpg "desktop; size: 1230 240; address: carmacars.ca/va/renters; pins: 1 68.3 34.6")

## Email the renter

Customer service, Sales, Fleet and Finance can all write to the renter from a booking: press **Email the renter**, or open the **Messages** tab.

1. Write a **Subject** and a **Message**, or pick a **Quick reply** to start from.
2. Press **Email the renter**. It goes from CarmaCars and the renter can answer in their account; the answer opens a task for customer service.
3. On a booking an insurer pays you can choose Blind Spot Car Rental (insurance) as the sender, and **Email the adjuster** writes to the adjuster on the booking.

The tab lists the messages both ways and every email of the booking with its state. Each email counts against the daily email limit, shown under the form.

### Find a booking
**Rentals** > **Find a booking**: type at least 3 characters of the booking number (CC-1042, 1042), the renter''s or a driver''s name, an email, a phone number, a plate or a car code, then press Enter. Every search is logged, as Find a renter.', 'Shared tools', 'The calendar and Find a renter.',
  'Every function has the calendar and Find a renter. Use them to answer questions fast.

## The calendar

1. Every car, its bookings, requests and blocks. The red line is now.
2. Use the arrows, Today and the range to move around, or search by plate, booking or name.
3. Fleet and customer service can remove a cleaning block from its side panel (**Remove the block**) when a car is ready sooner.

![](/guides/img/va-cs-09-calendar-desktop-541a6da5.jpg "desktop; size: 1230 800; address: carmacars.ca/va/calendar; pins: 1 60.2 33.8, 2 28.5 17.5")

## Find a car

**Bookings** > **Find a car** (Finance and Fleet: **Rentals** > **Find a car**). A renter quotes the car code on the car''s page (like CC-7F3A).

1. Type the car code, a plate, a VIN or the name. Each car shows its code, plate, status and its page on the site.
2. In Add a rental, type the car code or plate in the box above Car to choose it.

## Find a renter

1. Search by name, email, phone or booking number.
2. Opening a renter''s private details asks for a reason (**Open with a reason**). It is kept in the access log.

![](/guides/img/va-cs-07-renters-desktop-99cfd0ef.jpg "desktop; size: 1230 240; address: carmacars.ca/va/renters; pins: 1 68.3 34.6")

## Email the renter

Customer service, Sales, Fleet and Finance can all write to the renter from a booking: press **Email the renter**, or open the **Messages** tab.

1. Write a **Subject** and a **Message**, or pick a **Quick reply** to start from.
2. Press **Email the renter**. It goes from CarmaCars and the renter can answer in their account; the answer opens a task for customer service.
3. On a booking an insurer pays you can choose Blind Spot Car Rental (insurance) as the sender, and **Email the adjuster** writes to the adjuster on the booking.

The tab lists the messages both ways and every email of the booking with its state. Each email counts against the daily email limit, shown under the form.

### Find a booking
**Rentals** > **Find a booking**: type at least 3 characters of the booking number (CC-1042, 1042), the renter''s or a driver''s name, an email, a phone number, a plate or a car code, then press Enter. Every search is logged, as Find a renter.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer for new requests, replies to answer and urgent problems, even with the portal closed.

1. Open **Profile** (top of the menu). Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. The first page of the portal also offers it once.
2. Under **What to alert me about**: new requests, booking changes and messages are on for staff; payments are off until you tick them.
3. **Send a test alert** checks the device. **Remove** takes an old phone off.

On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**). Use your phone''s own Focus or Do Not Disturb for quiet hours.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Every function has the calendar and Find a renter. Use them to answer questions fast.</p><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-the-calendar" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The calendar</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Every car, its bookings, requests and blocks. The red line is now.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Use the arrows, Today and the range to move around, or search by plate, booking or name.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Fleet and customer service can remove a cleaning block from its side panel (<b class="gd-ui">Remove the block</b>) when a car is ready sooner.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/calendar</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/800"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-09-calendar-desktop-541a6da5.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="800"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:60.2%;top:33.8%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:28.5%;top:17.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b> (Finance and Fleet: <b class="gd-ui">Rentals</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b>). A renter quotes the car code on the car&#39;s page (like CC-7F3A).</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Type the car code, a plate, a VIN or the name. Each car shows its code, plate, status and its page on the site.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">In Add a rental, type the car code or plate in the box above Car to choose it.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a renter</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Search by name, email, phone or booking number.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Opening a renter&#39;s private details asks for a reason (<b class="gd-ui">Open with a reason</b>). It is kept in the access log.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/renters</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/240"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-07-renters-desktop-99cfd0ef.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="240"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:68.3%;top:34.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-email-the-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Email the renter</h2><p class="gd-p">Customer service, Sales, Fleet and Finance can all write to the renter from a booking: press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>, or open the <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b> tab.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Write a <b class="gd-ui">Subject</b> and a <b class="gd-ui">Message</b>, or pick a <b class="gd-ui">Quick reply</b> to start from.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>. It goes from CarmaCars and the renter can answer in their account; the answer opens a task for customer service.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">On a booking an insurer pays you can choose Blind Spot Car Rental (insurance) as the sender, and <b class="gd-ui">Email the adjuster</b> writes to the adjuster on the booking.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">The tab lists the messages both ways and every email of the booking with its state. Each email counts against the daily email limit, shown under the form.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">Find a booking</h3><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Rentals</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Find a booking</b>: type at least 3 characters of the booking number (CC-1042, 1042), the renter&#39;s or a driver&#39;s name, an email, a phone number, a plate or a car code, then press Enter. Every search is logged, as Find a renter.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer for new requests, replies to answer and urgent problems, even with the portal closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> (top of the menu). Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. The first page of the portal also offers it once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>: new requests, booking changes and messages are on for staff; payments are off until you tick them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> checks the device. <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes an old phone off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>). Use your phone&#39;s own Focus or Do Not Disturb for quiet hours.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'report-rentals-referrals-and-profile', 'chapter', 'academy', 'Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.

## Report a problem

1. Open **Report a problem** and choose the Car.
2. Choose What happened: **New damage found**, **Warning light**, **Collision while I was driving**, **Ticket or toll while I was driving**, **Lost property found** or **Something else**.
3. Write the Details: where, when and what you see.
4. Press **Take a photo** for each photo, then **Send the report**.

![](/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-3b903b20.jpg "phone; size: 390 1040; pins: 1 93.6 46.6, 2 93.6 64.9, 3 93.6 89.9")

> Watch out: In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.

## Add a rental for a renter you found

Your home address must be in your profile first: until it is, the page asks for it.

1. Open **Add a rental**. Choose the car, the dates and the places, then type the renter''s details. A renter already on file is found by their email. Car already out with the renter? Enter the pickup as when it left: it is recorded as on trip.
2. Press **Check the calendar and the price**. To charge another price, type it with the reason: a price far under the rate sheet is flagged for an Admin, not refused.
3. Choose **Send a payment link** or **Charge the saved card when the renter signs**. The renter pays online: you take no payment for it yourself.
4. Under Who found this client, choose **I sourced this client** or **Entered for CarmaCars**, then press **Add the rental**.

## Commissions

1. You earn 10% of the rental charge (before tax, after discounts, less refunds) of each rental you sourced: one you added and marked I sourced this client, or a booking made with your referral link.
2. It is earned when the rental is completed and paid in full, then an Admin approves it and it is paid on your pay date. Your home address must be in your profile: until it is, a commission waits as not earned yet.
3. **My sales** shows each commission: not earned yet, pending approval, approved, paid or reversed. A refund after payment comes off a later commission.

## Referrals and profile

1. **Referrals**: your own referral link. Press **Copy the link**, or let someone scan its QR code. A booking made with it counts as a rental you sourced.
2. **Profile**: **Save my phone**, your home address (**Change my home address**), **Set up two-step sign-in**, **Change my password** and **Sign out**.

![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg "phone; size: 390 920; pins: 2 92.3 78.3")

## Sign in with your phone number

Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.

1. On **Profile**, under Sign-in, press **Add and verify my phone number**, enter your mobile number and press **Text me a code**.
2. Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press **Verify**. Choose **My phone number (a code by text)** under Sign in with.
3. Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press **Text me a code** and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.

## Texts or email

On **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both** for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.
