select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'profile-and-notices', 'chapter', 'statements', 'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Profile and notices, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.
', 'Profile and notices', 'Contact details, notices about returns and bank account, transfers, two-step sign-in.',
  'Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.

## Contact details

Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.

## Change how returns are handled

1. Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.
2. Press **Send the notice**. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.

![](/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg "phone; size: 390 170")

## Bank account and transfers

1. To change the account we pay, press **Ask to change the bank account**. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.
2. To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press **Send the request**. A transfer needs CarmaCars'' written consent.
3. You see "Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing." We confirm each request by email.

## Two-step sign-in (recommended)

1. At the bottom of Profile and notices, press **Set up two-step sign-in**.
2. Scan the code with your authenticator app.
3. Type the 6 digits and press **Continue**. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.

Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open **Profile**, then under **Phone alerts** press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications. Choose the topics under **What to alert me about**. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**) and turn alerts on from there.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Your contact details, and the notices you can send us: how returns are handled, your bank account, and a transfer request.</p><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-contact-details" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Contact details</h2><p class="gd-p">Contact details shows your name, email, phone, address and bank account on file. To update these, ask us; we confirm by phone.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-change-how-returns-are-handled" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Change how returns are handled</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under How returns are handled, choose Paid monthly or Reinvested.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send the notice</b>. The change applies from the first Return Month that starts at least 10 days after we receive it.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/170"><img src="/guides/img/investor-04-profile-phone-5e6b0e83.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="170"></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-bank-account-and-transfers" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Bank account and transfers</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">To change the account we pay, press <b class="gd-ui">Ask to change the bank account</b>. We call you at the number on file to take the new details. A change applies 10 days after notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">To transfer an investment, choose it, fill in To (full name) and a Note, then press <b class="gd-ui">Send the request</b>. A transfer needs CarmaCars&#39; written consent.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">You see &quot;Received. CarmaCars will confirm in writing.&quot; We confirm each request by email.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-two-step-sign-in-recommended" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Two-step sign-in (recommended)</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">At the bottom of Profile and notices, press <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Scan the code with your authenticator app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type the 6 digits and press <b class="gd-ui">Continue</b>. From then on, every sign-in asks for a code.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Documents, further down the same page, lists your statements as files.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="profile-and-notices-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when a return is paid, a statement is ready or we send you a notice. Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, then under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b> press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. Choose the topics under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>. On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>) and turn alerts on from there.</p></section>');
-- GUIDES 0301 END
